  m_text: "\u2022 Your child will be assigned an ID number; their data will not be
    labeled with their name.\n\u2022 We will not intentionally collect identifying
    information about you or your child in the game data.\n\u2022 All data will be
    stored on secure computers or University-approved services (e.g., Box) controlled
    by the research team.\n\u2022 Once fully anonymized, data may be shared in repositories
    such as the Open Science Framework (OSF) for scientific transparency.\n\u2022
    If you or your child withdraw, data collected up to that point may still be used
    in anonymized analyses, stored and used as described above."
