  m_text: "\u2022 You will play a web-based video game where you control a spaceship
    that shoots targets, each associated with clusters of musical tones.\n\u2022
    You may stop playing at any time.\n\u2022 At the conclusion, you will complete
    a short (~10 minute) tone-identification assessment.\n\u2022 You will answer
    a brief questionnaire including age, gender, and music experience.\n\u2022 No
    audio or video will be recorded at any point."
